## 六、Controller 依赖关系

### pubspec.yaml 依赖（声明层）

**`feature_device_search/pubspec.yaml`**
- `core_base`, `core_ble`, `core_network`, `core_permission`, `core_theme`
- `flutter_riverpod`, `go_router`

**`feature_device_connect/pubspec.yaml`**
- `core_base`, `core_ble`, `core_theme`, `core_permission`
- `flutter_riverpod`, `go_router`
- （无 `core_network`）

**`feature_device_settings/pubspec.yaml`**
- `common_glasses_protocol`, `core_base`, `core_ble`, `core_theme`
- `flutter_riverpod`, `go_router`

**`feature_device_record/pubspec.yaml`**
- `common_glasses_protocol`, `core_base`, `core_ble`, `core_theme`, `core_permission`
- `flutter_riverpod`
- （无 `go_router`）

**`glasses_app/pubspec.yaml`**
- 依赖全部 4 个 device feature 包 + `feature_interpretation`
- 以及 `common_glasses_protocol`, `core_*` 全套

### Controller 运行时依赖（`ref.read` 层）

| Controller | Provider | 运行时依赖的 Core/Common Provider |
|------------|----------|----------------------------------|
| `DeviceSearchController` | `deviceSearchControllerProvider` | `permissionServiceProvider`, `bleServiceProvider`, `deviceNameFilterProvider` → `httpClientProvider` |
| `DeviceConnectController` | `deviceConnectControllerProvider` | `permissionServiceProvider`, `bleSessionProvider` |
| `DeviceSettingsController` | `deviceSettingsControllerProvider` | `glassesCommandSenderProvider`, `bleSessionProvider` |
| `DeviceRecordController` | `deviceRecordControllerProvider` | `glassesCommandSenderProvider`, `bleSessionProvider`, `permissionServiceProvider` |

### App 层注入的 Provider override（`app.dart`）

| Provider | 注入值 |
|----------|--------|
| `bleServiceProvider` | `FlutterBlueBleService()` |
| `networkConfigProvider` | AI gateway 配置 |
| `permissionServiceProvider` | `PermissionHandlerService()` |
| `onDeviceSelectedProvider` | 搜索选中设备 → `push /device/connect` |
| `interpretationConfigProvider` | WSS/鉴权配置 |

